  <p>
    Township and master-plan projects are about the whole, not the individual building.
    The relationships between plots, roads, open space and landscape are what matter, and
    a large-format physical model is still one of the clearest ways to present them.
  </p>
  <p>
    We model master plans and townships at a scale that fits the whole scheme into a single
    readable view, showing building footprints, circulation, green areas, water bodies and
